[{"name":"mcp__rightclick_x__context_actions","description":"RightClick X is a live, self-composing capability graph. Start with context_research (optionally with a topic) to see what this environment can do, context_learn to add any URL, context_compose to turn what you have into what you want across providers, and context_run to execute. The tool list never changes; the graph behind it does.

